e demo is free. Three full levels, a boss, a secret boss, and a fresh set of achievements to clean up before your conscience catches on.A wishlist on the full game wouldn’t hurt either. Cheers","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:11:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4544200-1842846814440192","game_id":"steam-4544200","kind":"update","title":"Update! Music and UI","summary":"Hello dear players! We have updated music in the main menu! Just load the game to listen to it! Feel the difference! Updated UI:Old UINew UIsome bugs and polishings also thereHave fun! Yours True Confession","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T12:45:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4544200-1841579228678420","game_id":"steam-4544200","kind":"announcement","title":"True Confession Demo is out!","summary":"The demo went through several difficult stages, and the last one was especially unpleasant — simply a three-week wait for Steam’s content review. For us it was fundamentally important to make an adult game and not censor the unconscious images of the main character. It was precisely because of them that the review took so long; the game is now rated 18+.We could have used softer wording, phrases, or safer imagery, but this game is itself a confession. It does not hide and does not conceal the tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T14:13:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678420","verified_at"